## Hero Image Crisis — Found and Fixed
- ALL hero images across all 3 sites were PNGs saved with .jpg extensions
- The imagine skill outputs PNG regardless of filename extension
- Cloudflare served them as image/jpeg content-type but bytes were PNG — broke in some contexts
- Fixed: batch-converted 272 files with PIL across all 3 repos (+2 regenerated: SVG-as-JPG, 1x1 placeholder)
- Total: 275 images fixed
- Added to all 3 generate.md files:
  1. Hero image existence check before push
  2. JPEG format validation (check FF D8 magic bytes, convert with PIL if PNG)
  3. Cache busting: append ?v={md5[:8]} to all hero image references
- Ray had to manually purge Cloudflare cache for immediate fix
- Note: we don't have a Cloudflare API token stored — would need one for automated purges

